---
title: AdviseCare - State Machine - Early-Support Indicator Flag
---

stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> open : import or rule change - the latest value hits an active rule
    open --> requested : an advisor asks to take the student on
    requested --> open : Programme Head turns the request down
    open --> caseOpened : Programme Head opens a case for an advisor
    requested --> caseOpened : Programme Head approves the advisor's request
    open --> dismissed : Programme Head dismisses with a reason
    open --> cleared : a later value no longer hits the rule
    caseOpened --> [*]
    dismissed --> [*]
    cleared --> [*]
